<title>USA: Heartland Wireless director bought shares.</title>
<headline>Heartland Wireless director bought shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartland Wireless Communications Inc director Allen Wheeler purchased 35,000 of the company's shares on November 18, according to CDA/Investnet, a Fort Lauderdale, Florida-based company which tracks transactions by company officers and directors.</p>
<p>Richardson, Texas-based Heartland Wireless owns and operates cable television systems.</p>
